WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.185
Tom stared at his wand.

2
00:00:04.186 --> 00:00:07.472
It was still sinking into the mud.

3
00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:24.805
He reached in to pull it out . . . and tumbled backwards!

4
00:00:24.806 --> 00:00:27.964
Tom sat down on a log.

5
00:00:27.965 --> 00:00:31.496
"This is terrible," he thought.

6
00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:34.765
"Princess Mary needs me!

7
00:00:34.766 --> 00:00:40.094
What am I going to do?"

8
00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:43.924
Cat dashed around the Royal Kitchen.

9
00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:48.758
She was chasing a mouse.

10
00:00:48.759 --> 00:00:52.724
Suddenly Cat stopped.

11
00:00:52.725 --> 00:00:56.219
She heard Cook talking to a servant.

12
00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:01.118
"Dirk sent Tom into the Dark Forest," Cook said.

13
00:01:01.119 --> 00:01:05.103
"He told Tom the tale of the pinkberry bush.

14
00:01:05.104 --> 00:01:08.893
He said it was the princess' only hope."

15
00:01:08.894 --> 00:01:11.772
"Oh no!" the servant said.

16
00:01:11.773 --> 00:01:14.948
"Tom will get lost in the Dark Forest.

17
00:01:14.949 --> 00:01:17.421
He'll never come back!"

18
00:01:17.422 --> 00:01:22.911
Cook nodded. "And the poor princess . . ."

19
00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:27.756
Cat didn't wait to hear anymore.

20
00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:37.063
She raced out of the palace.

21
00:01:37.064 --> 00:01:40.020
Tom looked around the forest.

22
00:01:40.021 --> 00:01:46.119
"Where is that pinkberry bush?"

23
00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:50.351
Crunch! Snap! Crunch! Snap!

24
00:01:50.352 --> 00:01:54.940
He heard more strange noises.

25
00:01:54.941 --> 00:01:58.715
Then Cat appeared!

26
00:01:58.716 --> 00:02:02.892
"I'm so glad to see you, Cat!" Tom cried.

27
00:02:02.893 --> 00:02:05.872
"I'm looking for the pinkberry bush!"

28
00:02:05.873 --> 00:02:07.942
Cat shook her head.

29
00:02:07.943 --> 00:02:10.619
"It's just a tale, Tom.

30
00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:14.138
Pinkberries only grow in the spring."

31
00:02:14.139 --> 00:02:17.036
"But . . ." Tom blinked.

32
00:02:17.037 --> 00:02:20.206
"Princess Mary is very sick.

33
00:02:20.207 --> 00:02:30.035
If I don't find some pinkberries, she might die!"

